# 平衡结束：清零步数，再开生产输出
reset_timestep  0
write_data      result_atoms.eq.data  nofix
System init for write_data ...
PPPM initialization ...
  using 12-bit tables for long-range coulomb
  G vector (1/distance) = 0.31275913
  grid = 24 24 24
  stencil order = 5
